### `ICapabilityStore`
Persistence and search for dynamic capabilities. Abstracted over `IStore<DynamicCapability>`.

```csharp
public interface ICapabilityStore
{
    Task<DynamicCapability> SaveAsync(DynamicCapability script, CancellationToken ct = default);
    Task<DynamicCapability?> GetByIdAsync(string id, CancellationToken ct = default);
    Task<DynamicCapability?> GetByTitleAsync(string title, CancellationToken ct = default);
    Task<IReadOnlyList<DynamicCapability>> SearchByKeywordsAsync(IEnumerable<string> keywords, CancellationToken ct = default);
    Task<IReadOnlyList<DynamicCapability>> SearchByTitleAsync(string searchTerm, CancellationToken ct = default);
    Task<IReadOnlyList<DynamicCapability>> GetAllAsync(CancellationToken ct = default);
    Task<bool> DeleteAsync(string id, CancellationToken ct = default);
}
```

