### `CapabilityPermission` (extends `Entity`)
Permission grant for a dynamic capability.

```csharp
public class CapabilityPermission : Entity
{
    public string ScriptId { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string PermissionName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public bool IsGranted { get; set; } = false;
    public DateTime? GrantedAt { get; set; }
    public DateTime? ExpiresAt { get; set; }
    public string? Scope { get; set; }
}

public record CapabiliyPermissionDescriptor(string Permission, string Description);
```

**Note:** The descriptor record is named `CapabiliyPermissionDescriptor` (typo - missing 't' in "Capabiliy"). This is used in `ICapabilityContext.RequestPermissionAsync` and `FileSystemAbi.RequirePermission`.

