### `CapabilityResultBag` and `CapabilityResultValue`

```csharp
public sealed class CapabilityResultBag
{
    public IReadOnlyDictionary<string, CapabilityResultValue> Values { get; }
    public void Set(string key, CapabilityResultValue value);
}

public sealed class CapabilityResultValue
{
    public required string Type { get; init; }
    public required JsonElement Value { get; init; }
}
```

- Keys validated: non-empty, max 64 chars, alphanumeric + `_` `-` `.` only.
- Values stored as `JsonElement` with type discriminator.

